'''Mystery Snowmound''' (謎の雪山, ''Nazo no Yukiyama'', '''Mysterious Snow Pile''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in [[Snow Doges]]. It was added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mystery Snowmound
|image = E 712.png
|first appearance = [[Snow Doges]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has the same stats as a [[Razorback]]. The only difference between the two is that Mystery Snowmound has one extra frame of backswing, which is hardly notable.

==Strategy==
One [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Oda Nobunaga]] or two or more [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercats]] are enough to permafreeze Mystery Snowmound. The number of Bombercats needed can be reduced to one if you use one "Freeze" Effect UP (M) or two (Sm) [[Cat Combo]]s.

If you don't have Nobunaga or Bombercat to freeze him, Mystery Snowmound is still beatable. Bring as many [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Darks]] as it takes to keep the pressure on him, such as [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Cooldown Cat]], [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Eastwood]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]], [[Pumpcat (Rare Cat)|Cat O'Lantern]], and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]].

